    LLM: 'Game: 10 Card Regrets Poker. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '10 Card Regrets is a split-pot poker variant. 2-5 players. 52-card deck. Players build TWO open 5-card hands simultaneously: a Low hand and a High hand. Dealt 2 cards at a time, must assign each to Low or High (irrevocable). Cards revealed after assignment. 5 dealing rounds with betting between each. Pot split: best High hand + best Low hand.',
